Wine server: with WINESERVER_STATS=1, time where the server's time goes

Debug only, off unless the app sets WINESERVER_STATS=1. Every 5 seconds the
server prints one line to stderr (the Wine log):

  wineserver-stats: 5.0 s: cpu user U ms sys S ms, waiting W ms, N wakeups E events,
  R requests: handling H ms, reading Q ms, replying P ms; slowest: name count/ms ...

cpu user/sys come from getrusage, so they are the server's real CPU time.
waiting is the time spent in epoll_wait. handling is the time inside request
handlers, per request type for the slowest ten; reading and replying are the
pipe reads and writes around them. What is left of the awake time goes to
fd events, timers and the rest of the main loop.

